  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support operationalisation of Tanzania&#x2019;s National Electric Vehicles Policy Framework to fast track deployment and scaling up of electric mobility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supports the implementation of Tanzania&apos;s National Electric Vehicles Policy Framework by strengthening awareness and coordination among relevant stakeholders.The project focuses on communicating the framework&#x2019;s policy actions and recommendations to ministries and agencies to support the integration of e mobility into their plans and procedures.In addition, the initiative includes awareness seminars for key public and private stakeholders on e-mobility best practices and supports the development of tax and non tax incentives to encourage the deployment of electric vehicles in Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
